# Routing Standards

## Route Organization
- Route file location: `app_[name]/router_[name]/router_[name].dart`
- All routes must include app prefix (e.g., qy_)
- All pages must be registered in the routing system
- Main entry configuration: `lib/util/route_manager.dart`

## Route Implementation
- Use GoRouter for navigation
- Route files must contain complete routing configuration
- Must implement error route handling
- Must implement route guards

## Route Structure
- Route names must match app prefix
- Must include complete route paths
- Must implement route parameter handling
- Must implement route return handling

## Best Practices
- Keep routing logic separate from UI
- Use route guards for permission control
- Handle navigation state properly
- Implement appropriate back navigation




